#: ../chapter11.rst:3
msgid "Upgrade CentreStack"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter11.rst:5
msgid "We publish updated notes to our public blog forum called `CentreStack Blog`_. It is recommended that you perform an update if your self-hosted CentreStack and clients are three months or older."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter11.rst:8
msgid "Using the GUI Installer to Upgrade"
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter11.rst:10
msgid "To install an update go to your `Partner Portal`_ (Self-Hosted CentreStack -> Download) and download the GUI installer."
msgstr ""

#: ../chapter11.rst:14
msgid "When you run the GUI installer, it will detect the existing installation and perform an upgrade."
msgstr ""
